直接用以下這段查詢，一次比對「已寫入數量」與「DJ符合條件的實際數量」：
SELECT 
    -- 1. 目前已成功寫入目標表且有效的數量
    (
        SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT T.remark)
        FROM BSADBJP..OFAC_SPEC T
        WHERE T.GROUPID = 5
          AND T.DInd = 'N'
    ) AS [目標表_已寫入有效筆數],

    -- 2. DJ 來源端符合條件的總人數 (Deceased=1 且 Japanese Finance)
    (
        SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT A.EntityId)
        FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity A
        JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_SanctionListReference B ON A.EntityId = B.EntityId
        WHERE A.Deceased = 1
          AND B.SanctionListReference LIKE '%Japanese Finance%'
    ) AS [DJ來源_符合條件總筆數];

結果判定
 * 兩邊數字一樣：代表來源端所有死亡名單都已完整寫入。
 * 目標表比來源少：代表有資料漏寫或被標記為刪除 (DInd = 'Y')。
若數字對不起來，查「哪幾筆沒寫入」
執行這段即可抓出「DJ 有符合條件，但目標表裡卻沒有」的名單：
SELECT 
    A.EntityId, 
    A.FullName
FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity A
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_SanctionListReference B ON A.EntityId = B.EntityId
WHERE A.Deceased = 1
  AND B.SanctionListReference LIKE '%Japanese Finance%'
  AND NOT EXISTS (
      SELECT 1 
      FROM BSADBJP..OFAC_SPEC T 
      WHERE T.GROUPID = 5 
        AND T.DInd = 'N'
        AND T.remark = CAST(A.EntityId AS VARCHAR(100))
  );

